Neovim Tutor: 08 NVCHAD WORKFLOW

Goal
  Learn common NvChad defaults and useful flows.

------------------------------------------------------------
Lesson 1: Discover keymaps
  <leader> is SPACE by default in NvChad.
  :NvCheatsheet shows your keymaps.

Practice:
  - Open the cheatsheet, then close it.

------------------------------------------------------------
Lesson 2: File navigation (Telescope)
  <leader>ff  find files
  <leader>fg  live grep
  <leader>fb  buffers

Practice:
  - Use <leader>ff to open a file in your config.

------------------------------------------------------------
Lesson 3: File tree
  <leader>e   toggle file tree

Practice:
  - Toggle the file tree and open a file.

------------------------------------------------------------
Lesson 4: LSP basics (if enabled)
  gd   go to definition
  K    hover docs
  gr   references

Practice:
  - Open a code file and try gd or K.

------------------------------------------------------------
Lesson 5: Formatting (if enabled)
  <leader>fm  format file

Practice:
  - Run <leader>fm in a file and undo if needed.

End of lesson 08.
You're done! Add more lessons in ~/.config/nvim/tutor/.
